  "notes": "117:1-7 uses Al-Muyassar's respectful reading for the Prophet ﷺ («وفَّق الله نبيه… إلى الإنابة إليه وطاعته»); no motif near «النبي». The expedition is glossed by its hardship only (heat, provisions, mounts), not by fighting. The three are named (Al-Muyassar). A sun for «ساعة العسرة», geometric for «لا ملجأ من الله إلا إليه», light for the turning in mercy."
